  "Documents": "DOKUMEN",
  "Documents and report screens export to PDF, Excel and CSV depending on the module, and backup sets copy the database files themselves. There is no lock-in format: your data is SQLite on your own disk.": "Layar dokumen dan laporan diekspor ke PDF, Excel, dan CSV bergantung pada Modul, dan Set Cadangan menyalin file database itu sendiri. Tidak ada format penguncian: data Anda adalah SQLite di disk Anda sendiri.",
  "Documents are stored as snapshots, so editing a customer later does not rewrite an old invoice.": "Dokumen disimpan sebagai snapshot, jadi mengedit pelanggan nanti tidak menulis ulang Faktur yang lama.",
  "Documents convert, they do not re-enter": "Dokumen dikonversi, tidak dimasukkan kembali",
